	    <td bgcolor="#CCFFFF">Much of the raw material (data) that we use for valuation comes from annual reports and financial filings. (10, 10Q). In this presentation, I lay out a template for extracting information from these filings, separating the stuff that matters from the stuff that does not, using P&amp;G in September 2012 as an illustration.</td>
