	    <td bgcolor="#CCFFFF"><p>Reconciling firm and equity valuation</p></td>
	    <td bgcolor="#CCFFFF"><ol>
	      <li><a href="wkch/wkch1.htm">Weekly challenge #1</a><br>
          </li>
