	  <tr bgcolor="#CCFF99">
	    <td align="center" bgcolor="#CCFFFF"><div align="left">Valuation Tools Webcast #2<br>
	      <a href="https://youtu.be/imfy-O9QuVc">Estimating a risk free rate </a></div></td>
	    <td bgcolor="#CCFFFF"><p><em>Estimating a risk free rate<br>
	      <br>
	      </em>Estimating a risk free rate should be simple but it is often not. In some currencies, where there are no default free entities, it may take some work getting to a risk free rate. In this webcast, I look at the mechanics of this adjustment. </p></td>
	    <td bgcolor="#CCFFFF"><ol>
	      <li><a href="https://www.stern.nyu.edu/~adamodar/pdfiles/cfovhds/webcasts/riskfree/riskfree.ppt">Presentation</a></li>
	      <li><a href="https://www.stern.nyu.edu/~adamodar/pdfiles/cfovhds/webcasts/riskfree/Moodys.pdf">Moody's ratings</a> (3/13)</li>
	      <li><a href="https://www.stern.nyu.edu/~adamodar/pdfiles/cfovhds/webcasts/riskfree/CDSfeb13.pdf">CDS spreads</a> (3/13)</li>
	      </ol></td>
      </tr>
	  <tr bgcolor="#FFFFCC">
	    <td rowspan="3" align="center" bgcolor="#CCFFFF"><div align="left">
