	    <td align="center" bgcolor="#CCFFFF"><p align="left"><a href="https://youtu.be/hARFCjXQ-G0">Valuation Tools Webcast #11: EV, Firm Value and Equity Value</a></p></td>
	    <td bgcolor="#CCFFFF">The &quot;value&quot; embedded in a multiple can be the value of the entire firm, the value of its operating assets (enterprise value) or the value of the equity. In this webcast, I look at the differences between the three and why you may use one over the other.</td>
