	    <td bgcolor="#CCFFFF">The exclusive rights to produce a product or provide a service can provide the owner with &quot;optionality&quot;, allowing for a premium on top of a discounted cash flow value. In this webcast, I look at a simplified example.</td>
	    <td bgcolor="#CCFFFF"><ol>
