	    <td bgcolor="#CCFFFF">With money-losing companies, with a lot of debt, equity takes on the characteristics of a call option (to liquidate the business). In this webcast, I look at the mechanics of applying this approach to a troubled company.</td>
	    <td bgcolor="#CCFFFF"><ol>
	      <li><a href="https://www.stern.nyu.edu/~adamodar/pdfiles/eqnotes/webcasts/DistressedEquity/jetindiaFA.pdf">Jet India Financials</a></li>
